Output Format (JSON):
{
    "nuance_analysis": "Identify the specific 'micro-features' that influenced the final decimal.",
    "scores": {
        "structural_complexity": [X.X],
        "cognitive_load": [Y.Y]
    },
    "positioning_justification": "A brief explanation of why the score deviates from a standard median."
}